<title>USA: Bridgewtr-Leonrdsvlle CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Bridgewtr-Leonrdsvlle CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross, Inc., said it won $3.650 million of Bridgewater-Leonardsville-West Winfield Central Sch Dist, N.Y., school district general obligation bonds 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.8776 percent.</p>
</text>
